msgstr "Accept invitation"

#: app/email.py:155
msgid ""
"De link verloopt na 48 uur. Verwacht je deze uitnodiging niet? Negeer "
"deze e-mail."
msgstr ""
"The link expires after 48 hours. Not expecting this invitation? Ignore "
"this email."

