#: app/email.py:167
msgid ""
"Je Otto-omgeving voor <strong>{{company}}</strong> is verwijderd. We "
"bewaren je gegevens nog <strong>{{restore_days}} dagen</strong> — daarna "
"worden ze definitief gewist."
msgstr ""
"Your Otto environment for <strong>{{company}}</strong> has been deleted. "
"We keep your data for another <strong>{{restore_days}} days</strong> — "
"after that it's permanently erased."

#: app/email.py:170
msgid ""
"Van gedacht veranderd? Vraag de beheerder van je Otto-installatie binnen "
"die termijn om alles terug te zetten."
msgstr ""
"Changed your mind? Ask the administrator of your Otto installation to "
"restore everything within that period."

