"Hello and welcome!\n"
"\n"
"Connect your mailbox via Settings → onboarding and Otto automatically "
"sorts your inbox and prepares draft replies. Otto never sends on its own "
"— you stay in control.\n"
"\n"
"Enjoy,\n"
"Otto"

