" placeholders — e.g. a LinkedIn URL or extension number. You fill them in"
" here for everyone; colleagues can also enter their own value under "
"Settings → My profile. Or link a field to a Microsoft 365/Entra attribute"
" (e.g. “city” or “onPremisesExtensionAttributes.extensionAttribute3”) — "
"Otto then fetches the value automatically."

