msgstr "Otto fills this in by itself once you've sent a few replies."

#: app/templates/app/user/settings.html:242
msgid "Schrijfstijl opslaan"
msgstr "Save writing style"

#: app/templates/app/user/settings.html:247
msgid "Opnieuw leren uit mijn verzonden mail"
msgstr "Relearn from my sent mail"

#: app/templates/app/user/settings.html:253
msgid "Synchronisatie"
msgstr "Synchronization"

#: app/templates/app/user/settings.html:255
msgid ""
"Otto haalt automatisch nieuwe e-mails op en zet er concepten bij klaar — "
"ook als de app dicht is. Kies hoe vaak dat gebeurt."
msgstr ""
"Otto automatically fetches new emails and prepares drafts for them — even"
" when the app is closed. Choose how often this happens."

#: app/templates/app/user/settings.html:261
msgid "Hoe vaak ophalen"
msgstr "How often to fetch"

#: app/templates/app/user/settings.html:269
#: app/templates/owner/scheduler.html:11
